{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggBkX38UBviySSeAi6dB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fitted the three spin-allowed triplet bands first to get Dq and B, then used the spin-forbidden ¹E band to fix C.\n\n**1. Dq and B from the triplet bands**\n\nIn the d⁸ octahedral model, the transition ³A₂g → ³T₂g is exactly 10Dq. The two ³T₁g levels (one from ³F, one from ³P) mix with each other, so their energies come from a 2×2 matrix. The sum of those two energies is 15B + 30Dq.\n\n- Exact solution, taking ν₁ as exactly 10Dq: Dq = 740 cm⁻¹. Then B = (12 660 + 23 840 − 3·7 400)/15 = 953 cm⁻¹. These values give calculated bands at 7 400, about 12 500 and about 24 000 cm⁻¹.\n- Least-squares fit of all three triplet bands: Dq = 748 cm⁻¹ and B = 934 cm⁻¹. The calculated bands are 7 481, 12 603 and 23 845 cm⁻¹, with an RMS error of 57 cm⁻¹ (R² = 0.99993). I adopt this fit.\n\n**2. C from the ¹E band**\n\nThe triplet bands do not depend on C, so the spin-forbidden ³A₂g → ¹Eg band is what fixes it. With the default C = 4 850 cm⁻¹, the model puts ¹Eg at 16 536 cm⁻¹, well above the observed 15 150 cm⁻¹. The ¹E energy rises by roughly 2 cm⁻¹ for every 1 cm⁻¹ increase in C. Lowering C to 4 150 cm⁻¹ (with Dq = 748 and B = 934) moves ¹Eg to 15 139 cm⁻¹. The other bands stay put: ³T₂g at 7 480, ³T₁g at 12 602 and ³T₁g(2) at 23 848 cm⁻¹. A small upward adjustment to about C ≈ 4 155 cm⁻¹ matches 15 150 cm⁻¹ exactly.\n\n**Results**\n\n- Dq ≈ 748 cm⁻¹, so 10Dq ≈ 7 480 cm⁻¹\n- B ≈ 934 cm⁻¹, which is about 90% of the free Ni²⁺ ion value of about 1 040 cm⁻¹. This small reduction is what you'd expect for strongly ionic fluoride bonding.\n- C ≈ 4 155 cm⁻¹, giving C/B ≈ 4.45\n\n{\"Dq\": 748, \"B\": 934, \"C\": 4155, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Dq and B fitted from the three triplet bands; C fixed by the spin-forbidden 1E band.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1360,"cache_read_input_tokens":9651,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1360,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1ee62d7-5c62-40a7-97ba-bb72fa0adcdd","uuid":"e2a3acd9-a4d9-4e5b-a1cc-66e972098446","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:54:11.854Z","request_id":"req_011CggBkWdKsYpN9j4gRNXiS"}
